{
  "id": "PSA.9",
  "number": "9",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psalms 9",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "To the chief Musician upon Muthlabben, A Psalm of David.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will praise",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thee",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.9.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.9.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.9.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.9.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", with my whole heart; I will shew forth all thy marvellous works.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will be glad and rejoice in thee: I will sing praise to thy name, O thou most High.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When mine enemies are turned back, they shall fall and perish at thy presence.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thou hast maintained my right and my cause; thou satest in the throne judging right.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou hast rebuked the heathen, thou hast destroyed the wicked, thou hast put out their name for ever and ever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O thou enemy, destructions are come to a perpetual end: and thou hast destroyed cities; their memorial is perished with them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.9.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.9.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall endure for ever: he hath prepared his throne for judgment.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he shall judge the world in righteousness, he shall minister judgment to the people in uprightness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.9.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.9.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "also will be a refuge for the oppressed, a refuge in times of trouble.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they that know thy name will put their trust in thee: for thou,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.9.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.9.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", hast not forsaken them that seek thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sing praises to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.9.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.9.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", which dwelleth in Zion: declare among the people his doings.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When he maketh inquisition for blood, he remembereth them: he forgetteth not the cry of the humble.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Have mercy upon me, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.9.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.9.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; consider my trouble",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which I suffer",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.9.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.9.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of them that hate me, thou that liftest me up from the gates of death:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That I may shew forth all thy praise in the gates of the daughter of Zion: I will rejoice in thy salvation.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The heathen are sunk down in the pit",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.9.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.9.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they made: in the net which they hid is their own foot taken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.9.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.9.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is known",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "by",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.9.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.9.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the judgment",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.9.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.9.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he executeth: the wicked is snared in the work of his own hands. Higgaion. Selah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The wicked shall be turned into hell,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.9.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.9.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all the nations that forget God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the needy shall not alway be forgotten: the expectation of the poor shall",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "not",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.9.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.9.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "perish for ever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arise, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.9.20"
            ]
